<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαιτ-ήεις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαιτάεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with long flowing hair,</i> epith. of Apollo,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.234
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eryc.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with a long mane,</i> of the horse, <i><span class="en">
				Phoc.
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1237
			</span></i>; of bears, <i>shaggy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of plants,
				<i>thick-leaved,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμινθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαιτέεις.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
